      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "(... Four years later, I hit this issue)\n\nThe problematic lines are here in `UdonProgramAsset.cs`\n\nThe yellow-circled part limits the lower boundary to zero, but the red-circled part expands it to one.\n\nAlso, the `Array.Resize` method creates a new array even if the passed array was `null` and the size was zero. So you can't set (or leave) the value to `null`.\n\n(2nd image: When the focus goes out, the size becomes `1`)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
