      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found a workaround: Edit and keep `0` in the size field and close the fold (triangular icon before the variable name).\n\n(It's awful but working. Actually, I think it's another bug.)\n\nNote for the dev. The following line in the capture `if(valueArray != null && valueArray.Length > 0)` is meaningless because `valueArray` cannot be null (by calling `Resize`) and next `for` loop works well even if the length is zero.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
