  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-28T16:59:48.415Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you use an UdonAssemblyProgramAsset and you have an array as a public variable, you can't set the array size to 0, it will always jump to 1.\nThis is however possible in regular inspectors and should also be possible here and lead to an uninitialized array (null reference) like it would be in Unity normally.",
